  "description": "Whether you're human or a ghost, if you have a ghost story, you're welcome here. Welcome. Urban legends, conspiracy theories, the occult, and science fiction, all these stories are intertwined here. Shamans and scientists, demons and priests, the past and the future all coexist in this space. There’s just one condition: you must be the protagonist of the horror story. There are no gory scenes. Though you might have a scary dream tonight.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
